// HOW IT WAS MADE. Six web-research passes (mainstream yoga, gentle/yin/restorative, stretching & mobility, physio & pain relief,
// Pilates/barre/tai chi, community picks and smaller or male-led channels) in October 2026, merged and de-duplicated. The research could
// only read web SEARCH RESULTS (YouTube, Reddit and the roundup pages themselves were not reachable), so:
//   - names are as the search results wrote them and may differ slightly from the exact YouTube title;
//   - only a few @handles were ever seen, so most entries have none (searching by name works regardless);
//   - sizes and activity are given only where a result said so;
//   - `voice` ('female' | 'male' | 'mixed') is set ONLY where a source stated it with a pronoun or a role ("husband and wife"), never from a
//     name. `voiceBy` is 'sure' when two passes agreed (or it is a very well-known teacher) and 'probable' when one source said so.
// It is a map to start from, not a guarantee: your own marks ("Teacher ▾") always win over `voice`, and nothing here is needed for the app to work.

